<p>Soymeal/Pellets (dollars per short tonne 48 pct profat)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> April	    17/10 D	 March	     21/17 D</p>
<p> May		18/15 D	 May		 21/17 D</p>
<p> July	     20/15 D	 July		22/18 D</p>
<p> August	     4/2 D	 August		8/5 D</p>
